### 變數設定 (方便切換環境)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1

### 1. 註冊新帳號 (Register)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test_user@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "displayName": "桌面小夥伴"
}

### 2. 帳號登入 (Login)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test_user@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 3. 測試驗證失敗 (故意傳送格式錯誤的 Email)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "invalid-email",
  "password": "123",
  "displayName": ""
}